{"ts": 0.142196, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mshells — gate\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\n", "len": 93}
{"ts": 0.142234, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "First, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 112}
{"ts": 0.144412, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.144691, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.144708, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.14846, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   The shell runs the programs you name. What kind of thing is the\r\n", "len": 87}
{"ts": 0.148525, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a program\n", "len": 10}
{"ts": 0.148555, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          shell itself?\r\na program\r\n", "len": 48}
{"ts": 0.151639, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          a program    a file    a folder    a window\r\n", "len": 67}
{"ts": 0.151674, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.162586, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.166679, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What do you type to ask whether zsh is installed?\r\n", "len": 73}
{"ts": 0.166769, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh\n", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.166799, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m command -v zsh\r\n", "len": 45}
{"ts": 0.177811, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.181769, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   \u001b[92mecho $SHELL\u001b[0m prints which shell?\r\n", "len": 64}
{"ts": 0.181879, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "login shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.181914, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "login shell\r\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.185029, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          the running one    your login shell    the newest one\r\n", "len": 77}
{"ts": 0.185064, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.195922, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.208171, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.209779, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshells  task\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.20983, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.209875, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mshells — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nFind out whether \u001b[92mzsh\u001b[0m is installed, and keep the answer in a file.\r\n", "len": 106}
{"ts": 0.209914, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  1. Ask the shell where zsh is.\r\n  2. Send what it prints into a file named zsh.txt.\r\n\r\nIf zsh is not installed the file is empty, and that is a right answer.\r\n\u001b[90mThis task runs in the module's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Do both steps, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 300}
{"ts": 0.212962, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.213252, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.228711, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.228828, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh > zsh.txt\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.228873, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "command -v zsh > zsh.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 35}
